== Quest Start ==
Talk to Strandar Pinemist in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Strandar Pinemist'
:''Strandar Pinemist says, 'Greetings, young one. Are you a [child of the forest]?' ''
You say, 'child of the forest'
:''Strandar Pinemist says, 'Then you are welcome in my presence.  I shall present to you six tests.  The tests of the land are of the [wolf], [bear], and [tree]. The tests of the sky are those of the [eagle], [bee], and [nature].' ''

== Druid Test of Wolf ==

You say, 'wolf'
:''Strandar Pinemist says, 'So you wish to take the test of the wolf, do you? Go forth unto the islands and find a worn leather mask, and a wind rune meda.  Bring them back to me, but not until you have both, and you shall be rewarded.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Drake-Hide Mask}}

